{"about_the_game":"Clash of Adventurers \u2122 is an Open World MMORPG developed by Devsland Soft, a studio incorporated to bring this project alive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe first Saga of Clash of Adventurers: 'Arrival of the Adventurers' is being developed using Unreal Engine 5 as Free To Play for PC Windows O.S.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nElemental forces attempt to take over the lands of Lumeria, you will take part as an Adventurer to restore the order and prevent the wild creatures from erasing the Human Race.<br />\r\nAs an adventurer you will be able to explore freely the lands of Lumeria and forge your own destiny, the only boundries are your skills and abilities to survive in the wild.<br />\r\nCollaboration and coordination are key values, playing the role of an Attacker, Defender or Support you will have to join other Adventurers to complete Quests, unlock Achievements, defeat the fantastic creatures unleashed in Lumeria, and perhaps engage in battle againt other Adventurers, much just like yourself, are shaping their own fate.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2760730?t=1737549776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2760730?t=1737549776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760730/7b7352df6a8334968ae8aba0a054525f16e93bc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737549776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760730/7b7352df6a8334968ae8aba0a054525f16e93bc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737549776","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Clash of Adventurers \u2122 is an Open World MMORPG developed by Devsland Soft, a studio incorporated to bring this project alive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe first Saga of Clash of Adventurers: 'Arrival of the Adventurers' is being developed using Unreal Engine 5 as Free To Play for PC Windows O.S.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nElemental forces attempt to take over the lands of Lumeria, you will take part as an Adventurer to restore the order and prevent the wild creatures from erasing the Human Race.<br />\r\nAs an adventurer you will be able to explore freely the lands of Lumeria and forge your own destiny, the only boundries are your skills and abilities to survive in the wild.<br />\r\nCollaboration and coordination are key values, playing the role of an Attacker, Defender or Support you will have to join other Adventurers to complete Quests, unlock Achievements, defeat the fantastic creatures unleashed in Lumeria, and perhaps engage in battle againt other Adventurers, much just like yourself, are shaping their own fate.","developers":["Devsland Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760730/header.jpg?t=1737549776","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Clash of Adventurers is a registered trademark owned by Devsland Soft Limited. All rights reserved to Devsland Soft Limited","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Clash of Adventurers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win